==English==
[[Image:Pocketknives.JPG|thumb|right|200px|an assortment of pocketknives]]

===Etymology===
From [[pocket]] + [[knife]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun|pocketknives}}

# A small [[knife]] whose [[blade]]s or [[tool]]s can fold in its [[handle]], and thereby be safely stowed in ones pocket.

